          "blocks": {
            "175757453781838ac891": {
              "type": "rich-text",
              "settings": {
                "content": "\u003col dir=\"auto\"\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eProceed to checkout with the items in your cart.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eYou will be redirected to PayPal's secure payment page.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eYou can either log in to your PayPal account OR select the option to 'Pay with Debit or Credit Card' to enter your card details as a guest.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003cli\u003eComplete your purchase securely.\u003c/li\u003e\n\u003c/ol\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003ePrivacy Guaranteed:\u003c/strong\u003e We do not store your credit card details on our servers. Your payment information is handled directly by PayPal. For more details on how PayPal protects your data, please refer to their \u003ca href=\"https://www.paypal.com/us/legalhub/privacy-full\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"\u003ePrivacy Policy\u003c/a\u003e.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eNote:\u003c/strong\u003e PayPal may apply standard fees for certain transactions (e.g., currency conversion), which are not controlled by us. We recommend reviewing PayPal's terms before checkout.\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp dir=\"auto\"\u003eIf you have any questions about our payment process, please contact our customer service team at \u003ca href=\"mailto:help@mudjean.com\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer nofollow\"\u003ehelp@mudjean.com\u003c/a\u003e or visit our \u003ca id=\"17587827247452\" href=\"/pages/contact\" target=\"_self\" data-link=\"{\u0026quot;pageType\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;value\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;contact\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;linkType\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;select\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;label\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;Contact\u0026quot;}\"\u003eContact Us\u003c/a\u003e\u003ca id=\"17587827246241\" href=\"/pages/contact\" target=\"_self\" data-link=\"{\u0026quot;pageType\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;value\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;contact\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;linkType\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;select\u0026quot;,\u002